    "scope": "For a fixed original six-slot BF16 return, place one complete ordered reducer anywhere per row. Include the final vector to the source. Free capacity, metadata and all same-card traffic. Counts are exact logical volume extrema for this relaxation, not latency. These are historical C8 layer 0/20 M3 routes; ordinary graph route IDs were not collected."
