  "assumptions": [
    "Same source-row geometry across captures; native matched-vs-local deltas with synthetic weights are linear in changed logical traffic and translate each layer by the same amount across ranks. Use the 12 full paired rounds without selecting layers by outcome.",
    "Deliver new final cross-card BF16 results from the translated original F21 exits. Assume effective end-to-end receiver bandwidth including contention, simultaneous feasible flows, no additional setup, known row mapping and no extra producer readiness cost. Serial, four-shared-task and full-window overlap scenarios retain the same observed first consumer.",
    "Use corrected last ForeachAddList start among the 16 receivers as the common reader frontier. Every layer shift translates the rest of its carrier; credit cumulative carriers through each request first token and recompute P90. Real dependencies need not retire on that common frontier; ranges from clocks and paired rounds are not prediction intervals.",
    "Unmatched M818 gets zero credit; M834 is used only in the separately labeled free-final sensitivity and is not used in the matched result. Positive means reduced latency. Branch V1 for M*6>4096, V2 otherwise. A new owner for downstream shared addition or HcPost, earlier tile readiness and changed reduction order are different cases."
  ],
